  "subtitle": "Dr Marit Osayande, Convenor of the Living Dashboard",
  "summary": "A short profile of Dr Marit Osayande, Convenor of the Living Dashboard, told largely in her own words. Recalling a transit authority's status board that ran for years with no one assigned to read it, Dr Osayande describes how she now follows an organisation's boards, from staff-photo boards in childcare foyers to roadside fuel-price boards and aged-care front-desk whiteboards, from the day they go up to the day nobody looks. The film also celebrates a body of work cited right across the University.",
